WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.740
So, I want to pick up in volume 16, February the 10th, and we're talking about total surrender

2
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.740
to the divine will.

3
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:18.720
And the thing is total, 100%, not 75%.

4
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.340
Louisa said, "I was thinking to myself about all that was written in these past days, and

5
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:28.260
I said to myself that they were neither necessary nor serious things."

6
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:33.940
She usually gets corrected when she says that, that I could have done without putting them

7
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:34.940
on paper.

8
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:43.100
But obedience wanted it so, and I had the duty to say "fiat" also in this.

9
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:48.340
